  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset: one 4:3 landscape painting for The Burnt Book Sanskrit learning story. Request 1536 x 1152 native output or the closest supported native 4:3 resolution. Refined Indian watercolor with restrained gouache on warm ivory paper; organic detail, quiet ochre, sage, dusty terracotta, muted indigo. Warm, gentle, evocative storytelling, consistent character design.\nCanonical scene brief: A small quick spirit sitting on a tree stump with strings of tiny glass beads around its neck and wrists, sliding a bead onto a larger bead marked with a root; Śuka cocking his head; Dādī and the Vetāla watching; firelight on the glass.\nCharacter appearances:\nyou: Always seen from behind or at a distance, face never detailed, so every learner can be the hero: a young person in a simple ochre kurta with a cloth shoulder bag.\ndadi: A warm, sharp-eyed grandmother in her seventies, silver hair in a low bun, round spectacles, a cream cotton sari with a thin maroon border and a grey shawl; carries a cloth-bound notebook.\nshuka: A bright green rose-ringed parrot with a red beak and a faint pink and black neck ring, a little scruffy, very expressive eyes; usually on your shoulder or Dādī's.\nvetala: A long, thin, ash-grey spirit hanging upside down from a śiṃśapā branch by its ankles, arms folded across its chest, bright amused eyes, a shawl of mist trailing downwards; strange, never frightening.\nyojaka: A small quick spirit with strings of tiny glass beads around its neck and wrists, each bead holding a prefix; it clicks them as it speaks.\nPhone-first composition: clear compact narrative grouping, essential faces, hands and objects comfortably inside all edges. Show the complete scene without border. No collage or multi-panel layout.\nOwner-approved writing: render the following EXACT text, and no other writing, on the physical surface described in the scene. Use generous size, clear orthographic shapes and accurate Devanagari. The same text remains live app content. Do not substitute, omit, add or invent letters. No watermark, UI or extra labels.\nगम् All human and humanoid figures wear complete opaque traditional clothing or robes.",
